## Common Mistakes

### ❌ Wrong Imports

```typescript
// Don't use these
import { spawn } from 'bun';  // Wrong API
import { spawn } from 'child_process';  // Node.js
import fs from 'fs';  // Node.js
```

### ✅ Correct Imports

```typescript
// Use these
import processManager from './tests/utils/process-cleanup';
const file = Bun.file('path');
import { describe, test } from 'bun:test';
```

## Rules Summary

1. ✅ Use [processManager](mdc:tests/utils/process-cleanup.ts) for all process spawning
2. ✅ Use Bun file APIs (not Node.js fs)
3. ✅ Use Bun test runner (not Vitest/Jest)
4. ✅ Use bun commands (not npm/yarn)
5. ✅ Use Bun native APIs when available
6. ❌ Never use `Bun.spawn()` directly
7. ❌ Never use Node.js `child_process`
8. ❌ Never use Node.js `fs` module
9. ❌ Never install packages for Bun-native features
